        "raw": "We had a situation today where some rats dealt damage damage to the 2 lowest hp targets.  The first was Ra, and he had his \"fire shield\" (I forget the actual name) up.  That combined with some of his boosters immediately killed the rat.  So my question is, does this stop the rat from dealing damage to the second target?  And more generally, can destroying the source of an effect WHILE it's resolving, stop the effect from completing?\n\nI believe this is ultimately the relevant question for this (http://greaterthangames.info/forum/index.php/topic,371.0.html) discussion as well.",
